//! Hangar's client of `codex app-server`, the JSON-RPC protocol Codex serves to the clients of its
//! threads (docs/native/agents.md §4.3, D10): attached panes and headless children.
//!
//! [`generated`] is the protocol itself: the types of the pinned Codex release, generated by
//! scripts/codex-protocol/ from the JSON Schema that release prints (`codex app-server
//! generate-json-schema`), reduced to the methods Hangar uses. It is regenerated when the pin
//! moves, never edited by hand (scripts/codex-protocol/README.md). Its decoding is lenient: a newer
//! Codex's unknown fields are ignored, and its unknown variants, notifications and requests are kept
//! as `Unrecognized` instead of failing.

pub mod generated;

